{"5415860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Beach Volleyball VR","steam_appid":5415860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEP ONTO THE COURT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rhythm of beach volleyball in VR. Receive the serve, control the pass, work with your teammate, attack the set and meet your opponent above the net.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach Volleyball VR<\/strong> is built around physical, responsive volleyball interactions. Your movement and timing determine how you play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY VOLLEYBALL WITH YOUR OWN MOVEMENTS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Receive serves and attacks with forearm passes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set the ball for your teammate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Serve using natural volleyball motions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attack with powerful spikes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Block incoming attacks<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn to control direction, power and timing through practice<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE 2v2 BEACH VOLLEYBALL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump directly into a match against AI players or create an online room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Bots<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete 2v2 matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three AI difficulty levels<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play offline whenever you want with bots or trainings<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Private or public multiplayer rooms<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Up to four human players<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play together or against each other<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Empty player positions can be filled by bots<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cross-platform multiplayer (Meta Quest, SteamVR or any platform)<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN, PRACTICE AND IMPROVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided tutorial introduces movement and the fundamental volleyball actions before putting you into a full match.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then head into Training whenever you want to practice individual skills without worrying about the score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Passing<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Setting<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attacking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ball control<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Serving<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional assistance settings also make the game easier to approach for players who want help with positioning or reaching the net.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR VR<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach Volleyball VR is designed around the physical strengths of virtual reality rather than adapting traditional controller-based volleyball to a headset.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physical VR passing, setting, serving, attacking and blocking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete 2v2 beach-volleyball matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player matches with AI teammates and opponents<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Private or public online multiplayer for up to four players<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cross-platform multiplayer (Meta Quest, SteamVR or any platform)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bots can fill empty positions in multiplayer matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three AI difficulty levels<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guided tutorial<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training modes for practicing volleyball skills<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- VR comfort and accessibility options<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEP ONTO THE COURT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rhythm of beach volleyball in VR. Receive the serve, control the pass, work with your teammate, attack the set and meet your opponent above the net.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach Volleyball VR<\/strong> is built around physical, responsive volleyball interactions. Your movement and timing determine how you play.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY VOLLEYBALL WITH YOUR OWN MOVEMENTS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Receive serves and attacks with forearm passes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set the ball for your teammate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Serve using natural volleyball motions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attack with powerful spikes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Block incoming attacks<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn to control direction, power and timing through practice<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE 2v2 BEACH VOLLEYBALL<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump directly into a match against AI players or create an online room.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play With Bots<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete 2v2 matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three AI difficulty levels<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play offline whenever you want with bots or trainings<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Online<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Private or public multiplayer rooms<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Up to four human players<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play together or against each other<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Empty player positions can be filled by bots<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cross-platform multiplayer (Meta Quest, SteamVR or any platform)<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN, PRACTICE AND IMPROVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided tutorial introduces movement and the fundamental volleyball actions before putting you into a full match.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then head into Training whenever you want to practice individual skills without worrying about the score.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Passing<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Setting<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attacking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ball control<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Serving<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional assistance settings also make the game easier to approach for players who want help with positioning or reaching the net.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILT FOR VR<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach Volleyball VR is designed around the physical strengths of virtual reality rather than adapting traditional controller-based volleyball to a headset.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physical VR passing, setting, serving, attacking and blocking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete 2v2 beach-volleyball matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player matches with AI teammates and opponents<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Private or public online multiplayer for up to four players<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cross-platform multiplayer (Meta Quest, SteamVR or any platform)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bots can fill empty positions in multiplayer matches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three AI difficulty levels<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guided tutorial<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Training modes for practicing volleyball skills<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- VR comfort and accessibility options<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Beach Volleyball VR brings 2v2 beach volleyball to virtual reality. Pass, set, spike, serve and block using natural VR movements, play complete matches against bots, or jump online and play with friends.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5415860\/f4fa0f99c6096090433123c38a1498592cb02f24\/header.jpg?t=1793736396","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5415860\/a05aa093d95c008c568e2209512383b387ce53ad\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793736396","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5415860\/a05aa093d95c008c568e2209512383b387ce53ad\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793736396","website":"https:\/\/arcanestudio.dev.br\/beachvolleyballvr","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti 6 GB or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> OpenXR via SteamVR; compatible VR headset and tracked motion controllers required. Standing or Room Scale.<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> VR headset required. Internet required for online multiplayer.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti 6 GB or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> OpenXR via SteamVR; compatible VR headset and tracked motion controllers required. Standing or Room Scale.<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> VR headset required. Internet required for online multiplayer.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"min